{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2023-03-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION TO INTRODUCE NEW STRATEGIC GROWTH PLAN AT INVESTOR DAY ON NOVEMBER 16', 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , MARCH 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE:FMC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HOST AN INVESTOR DAY ON THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 16, 2023, WHERE IT WILL INTRODUCE THE COMPANY'S NEW LONG-RANGE STRATEGIC GROWTH PLAN. THE EVENT WILL TAKE PLACE AT THE FMC CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS IN PHILADELPHIA."}